---@field target string The name of the attribute that contains the result of the template.
---@field template string A formula with one or more attributes and raw text.
---@field type datadog.v1.LogsStringBuilderProcessorType|string

---Type of logs string builder processor.
---@alias datadog.v1.LogsStringBuilderProcessorType "string-builder-processor"

